**Gates:** 235 of 300 A1B1 models pass every gate.

| Predictor | Pass / models | Best passing model (ranking score) |
|---|---|---|
| af3 | 106/150 | 0.963 |
| protenix | 50/50 | 0.930 |
| boltz-2 | 46/50 | 0.923 |
